    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7dc952ef2219058a361a881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，好棒的歌曲！\\n情绪整个嗨起来咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761a8b881706f21ab01312d3b64189ac778ad7b8ce49a7b7208aa147f779d067",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "92"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/92"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:938ab25003407250fffe1a9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得轻快的歌词啦旋律啦\\n是都很棒……但要摆动尾巴这点\\n该说是会有点难为情吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f16adc08ccd6db1b440d0e553c6e2a5d2634973264b359319ea7d407e7ffa74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "93"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/93"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dcd12247d2b44802e6054a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦～这样就能知道你的喜好啊。\\n所以说，你喜欢哪种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf73b5fcf98f4c1ecde61f044fcec9ada800b372caf7d2886872c264b6443262",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "94"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/94"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc43b6ed47237a8261220d00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪耀！率直！发光！\\n……怎么样！？我试着用班长作风\\n表达出这首歌的感动之处了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d6b473989023df394160e758735ad55ae48fdaac60d2c0ec95e964e48c8577",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "95"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/95"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88294818247c5e522fcb0522",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员也一起来！\\n爆进爆进爆进！\\n很好！以894次为目标，再做一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5349c957223b2266d31e591593315bf33f0d6473a224508f8a90025f0324d454",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "96"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/96"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56601adc9444d6b26e7777a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "演唱会的预习和复习也不该偷懒！\\n音乐预备……爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc995420058486804300d5a04a8ef02112122786594b11b0320dbea18884b49d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "97"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/97"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:784bb8acdd9f3a496ae6bded",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要有训练员在身旁，\\n不管是什么情况我都能跑。\\n我就来证明这点给你看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb3023789e487aff4be2e0ad79337be7aaacec7e6d4090704537d5948a55925",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "98"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/228/98"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8162b9ca10720fe7e7c6c537",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来吧，现在是音乐时间喔～♪\\n训练员喜欢的歌曲\\n是哪一首呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a633d51944eb309695453135c93e4279409ed682278ca5da48cee44636f4693d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
